msgstr "Riwayat ponsel: respons diterima"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:977
msgid "Phone history: request failed or no response yet"
msgstr "Riwayat ponsel: permintaan gagal atau belum ada respons"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:980
msgid "Background downloads paused at the storage limit."
msgstr "Unduhan latar belakang dijeda karena batas penyimpanan."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:981
msgid "Background downloads paused: storage usage could not be measured."
msgstr ""
"Unduhan latar belakang dijeda: penggunaan penyimpanan tidak dapat diukur."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:986
msgid "Background media storage limit"
msgstr "Batas penyimpanan media latar belakang"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:987
msgid ""
"Pause new background downloads at this limit. Existing archived files are "
"kept. Increase it to continue, or use 0 for unlimited (MiB)."
msgstr ""
"Jeda unduhan latar belakang baru saat mencapai batas ini. File arsip yang "
"sudah ada tetap disimpan. Naikkan batas untuk melanjutkan, atau gunakan 0 "
"untuk tanpa batas (MiB)."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:997
msgid "Unused cache cleanup"
msgstr "Pembersihan cache yang tidak digunakan"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:998
msgid ""
"Remove only old, unreferenced media-cache files. Archived attachments and "
"background recovery files stay saved. Removed files may not be recoverable."
msgstr ""
"Hanya hapus berkas cache media lama yang tidak lagi dirujuk. Lampiran yang "
"diarsipkan dan berkas pemulihan latar belakang tetap tersimpan. Berkas yang "
"dihapus mungkin tidak dapat dipulihkan."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1003
msgid "Remove unused files automatically"
msgstr "Hapus berkas yang tidak digunakan secara otomatis"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1006
msgid "Keep unused files for this many days"
msgstr "Simpan berkas yang tidak digunakan selama jumlah hari ini"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1010
msgid "Keep all files (default)"
msgstr "Simpan semua berkas (bawaan)"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1019
msgid "Encrypted account backups"
msgstr "Cadangan akun terenkripsi"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1020
msgid ""
"Save the account and downloaded files with a passphrase. Restore into a "
"separate account, initially offline."
msgstr ""
"Simpan akun dan file unduhan dengan frasa sandi. Pulihkan ke akun terpisah "
"yang awalnya offline."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1023
msgid "Back up…"
msgstr "Cadangkan…"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1027
msgid "Restore…"
msgstr "Pulihkan…"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1032
msgid "Review merge…"
msgstr "Tinjau penggabungan…"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1039
msgid "Restored account connection"
msgstr "Koneksi akun yang dipulihkan"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1042
msgid ""
"This account stays offline until you resume its saved linked-device session."
msgstr ""
"Akun ini tetap offline sampai Anda melanjutkan sesi perangkat tertaut yang "
"tersimpan."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1049
msgid "Resume connection…"
msgstr "Lanjutkan koneksi…"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1062
msgid "Download folders"
msgstr "Folder unduhan"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1065
msgid ""
"Organize future downloads in your chosen folder. Existing files stay where "
"they are."
msgstr ""
"Atur unduhan berikutnya dalam folder yang dipilih. File yang sudah ada tetap"
" di tempatnya."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1091
msgid "Include older files in automatic downloads"
msgstr "Sertakan file lama dalam unduhan otomatis"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1092
msgid ""
"Copy files from before automatic downloads were enabled into your chosen "
"folder. Full history recovery still keeps older files in the private "
"archive."
msgstr ""
"Salin file dari sebelum unduhan otomatis diaktifkan ke folder pilihan Anda. "
"Pemulihan riwayat lengkap tetap menyimpan file lama di arsip pribadi."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1096
msgid "Preserve original download names"
msgstr "Pertahankan nama unduhan asli"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1097
msgid ""
"Use the original document filename inside your chosen folders. Unsafe "
"characters are removed and duplicate names get a number."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan nama file dokumen asli di folder pilihan Anda. Karakter yang tidak "
"aman dihapus dan nama duplikat diberi nomor."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1101
msgid "Readable download names"
msgstr "Nama unduhan yang mudah dibaca"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1102
msgid ""
"Include the chat, message date (UTC), file type and original document name. "
"The private media archive keeps its own files."
msgstr ""
"Sertakan chat, tanggal pesan (UTC), jenis file, dan nama dokumen asli. Arsip"
" media pribadi menyimpan filenya sendiri."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1118
