#: src/ui/login.rs:183
msgid "Waiting for a code from WhatsApp…"
msgstr "Menunggu kode dari WhatsApp…"

#: src/ui/login.rs:194
msgid ""
"Unofficial client. Using it may be against WhatsApp's terms of service."
msgstr ""
"Klien tidak resmi. Penggunaannya mungkin melanggar ketentuan layanan "
"WhatsApp."

#: src/ui/login.rs:219
msgid "Link this computer"
msgstr "Tautkan komputer ini"

#: src/ui/login.rs:234 src/ui/login.rs:297
msgid "Open WhatsApp on your phone"
msgstr "Buka WhatsApp di ponsel Anda"

#: src/ui/login.rs:235 src/ui/login.rs:298
msgid "Tap Menu or Settings, then Linked devices"
msgstr "Ketuk Menu atau Setelan, lalu Perangkat tertaut"

#: src/ui/login.rs:238
msgid "Tap Link a device and point the phone at this code"
msgstr "Ketuk Tautkan perangkat dan arahkan ponsel ke kode ini"

#: src/ui/login.rs:256
msgid "Link with phone number instead"
msgstr "Tautkan dengan nomor telepon"

#: src/ui/login.rs:270
msgid "Enter this code on your phone"
msgstr "Masukkan kode ini di ponsel Anda"

#: src/ui/login.rs:277
#, rust-format
msgid "for +{phone}"
msgstr "untuk +{phone}"

#: src/ui/login.rs:301
msgid "Tap Link a device, then Link with phone number instead"
msgstr "Ketuk Tautkan perangkat, lalu Tautkan dengan nomor telepon"

#: src/ui/login.rs:323
msgid "Copy code"
msgstr "Salin kode"

#: src/ui/login.rs:346
msgid "How much history would you like to sync?"
msgstr "Berapa banyak riwayat yang ingin disinkronkan?"

#: src/ui/login.rs:355
msgid ""
"Full history recovers as much as WhatsApp makes available, with older "
"messages and files continuing in the background."
msgstr ""
"Riwayat lengkap memulihkan sebanyak yang disediakan WhatsApp, dengan pesan "
"dan file lama terus diunduh di latar belakang."

#: src/ui/login.rs:365
msgid ""
"This can take a long time and use significant internet data and disk space. "
"Keep your phone online during recovery. Some older messages or files may be "
"unavailable."
msgstr ""
"Ini dapat memakan waktu lama serta menggunakan banyak data internet dan "
"ruang disk. Biarkan ponsel online selama pemulihan. Sebagian pesan atau file"
" lama mungkin tidak tersedia."

#: src/ui/login.rs:387
msgid ""
"Recent history starts with recent conversations for a quicker setup. You can"
" enable older-history recovery later in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Riwayat terbaru dimulai dari percakapan terbaru agar pengaturan lebih cepat."
" Pemulihan riwayat lama dapat diaktifkan nanti di Setelan."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:19
msgid "Restore an account backup"
msgstr "Pulihkan cadangan akun"

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:21
msgid "Back up this account"
msgstr "Cadangkan akun ini"

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:27
msgid "Merge messages into this account"
msgstr "Gabungkan pesan ke akun ini"

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:30
msgid ""
"A matching account identity and an exact preview are required. Current "
"messages and work queues stay intact. Conflicting edits and imported pending"
" work are retained separately without sending."
msgstr ""
"Identitas akun yang cocok dan pratinjau yang tepat diperlukan. Pesan dan "
"antrean kerja saat ini tetap utuh. Suntingan yang bertentangan dan pekerjaan"
" tertunda yang diimpor disimpan secara terpisah tanpa mengirim apa pun."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:34
msgid ""
"Merge historical messages and files. The current linked-device identity "
"stays in use."
msgstr ""
"Gabungkan pesan dan file historis. Identitas perangkat tertaut saat ini "
"tetap digunakan."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:36
msgid ""
"Restore into a separate account. Existing accounts stay intact. Full backups"
" include the linked-device identity; archive-only backups open offline."
msgstr ""
"Pulihkan ke akun terpisah. Akun yang sudah ada tetap utuh. Cadangan lengkap "
"mencakup identitas perangkat tertaut; cadangan khusus arsip dibuka offline."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:38
msgid ""
"Save this account, its linked-device identity and downloaded files in an "
"encrypted backup. The connection pauses while saving. Keep the passphrase "
"safe: it cannot be recovered."
msgstr ""
"Simpan akun ini, identitas perangkat tertaut, dan file unduhan dalam "
"cadangan terenkripsi. Koneksi dijeda selama penyimpanan. Simpan frasa sandi "
"dengan aman: frasa tersebut tidak dapat dipulihkan."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:43
